{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    " (and %lld more)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（另有 %lld 项）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " and loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，并自行加载其 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %@ left": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · 剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %@/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · %@/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %lld%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · %lld%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %lld/%lld files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · %lld/%lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (%@). %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（%@）。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (%lld/%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（%lld/%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (HTTP %lld). %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（HTTP %lld）。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (web app)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（网页应用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Orientation and resolution apply the next time the game starts, and a game already running in this session needs Husk closed and opened again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 方向和分辨率将在下次启动游戏时生效；本次会话中已运行的游戏需要关闭并重新打开 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ after sending %lld bytes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（已发送 %lld 字节后）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ closed the app on purpose (%@). Apps with anti-tamper or anti-cheat protection do this when they find they are not on a certified Android phone, which Husk cannot pretend to be for them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 主动关闭了应用（%@）。带有防篡改或反作弊保护的应用发现运行环境不是受认证的 Android 手机时会这样做，而 Husk 无法伪装成这种设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ free on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ free on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备剩余 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has been started in this run of Husk. Close Husk and open it again to restore saves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已在本次 Husk 运行中启动。关闭并重新打开 Husk 才能恢复存档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has not saved anything yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 还没有保存任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is compressed inside its bundle, which Husk cannot unpack yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 在包内被压缩，Husk 暂时无法解包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 为空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is gone from Android.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已从 Android 中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is ready to launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已可启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is still loaded, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk with the button above, then open it again to play %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 仍在运行，游戏一旦启动便无法卸载。请用上方按钮关闭 Husk，再重新打开即可游玩 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ / %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ opens by itself once Android has started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 启动完成后 %@ 会自动打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ update": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was started in this session, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk completely and open it again to run %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已在本次会话中启动，游戏一旦启动便无法卸载。请完全关闭 Husk 再重新打开以运行 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was started in this session. Close Husk completely and open it again to run %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已在本次会话中启动。请完全关闭 Husk 再重新打开以运行 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, minimised": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@，已最小化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Open the Android screen and check it is running, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。打开 Android 界面确认它正在运行，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@… %lld%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@… %lld%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld APKs (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个 APK（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld Downloading": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在下载 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps in DeveloperTesting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperTesting 中有 %lld 个应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld controllers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个手柄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld downloading": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在下载 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld downloading%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在下载 %lld 项%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld downloads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已发送 %lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 帧/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld frame(s) drawn · native runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已绘制 %lld 帧 · 原生运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld frame(s) posted · driving lifecycle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已提交 %lld 帧 · 正在驱动生命周期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min · first boot takes 5–15 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟 · 首次启动需 5–15 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of them use tricks the older loader could not handle; the native runtime handles those too, except for optional anti-tamper code, which it leaves out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 个使用了旧版加载器无法处理的技巧；原生运行时也能处理这些，但可选的防篡改代码除外，那部分会被跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld relocations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次重定位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld shared code/data pages": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个共享代码/数据页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld system calls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次系统调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld thread-register reads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次线程寄存器读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld × %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld × %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%  ·  %@  ·  %@ elapsed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld% · %@ · 已用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld×%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld×%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 pixel per point. Fastest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1 像素。最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.5 pixels per point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1.5 像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 pixels per point. The default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 2 像素。默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5599 (husk_agent): %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5599（husk_agent）：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A %@ game. It runs through Husk's native runtime, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 %@ 游戏。它通过 Husk 的原生运行时运行，运行时自行加载其 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Flutter app. Its engine and its compiled Dart run natively through Husk's translation layer, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 Flutter 应用。其引擎和编译后的 Dart 代码通过 Husk 翻译层原生运行，翻译层自行加载其 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup is a .zip of everything %@ has saved in Husk, to keep in Files or move to another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份是一个 .zip 文件，包含 %@ 在 Husk 中保存的全部内容，可存放到“文件”或迁移到其他设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A console-style home: your games on a shelf, the one you pick fills the screen with its artwork, and Play is one tap away. Android and PS4 games side by side, a new library, in light or dark as Settings › Appearance says.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机风格的主页：游戏陈列在架子上，选中的游戏以封面铺满屏幕，一键即玩。Android 与 PS4 游戏并排显示，全新资料库，浅色或深色外观由“设置 › 外观”决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A download failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一项下载失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick choices first. Everything here can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先做几个快速选择，之后都可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Android image is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新的 Android 镜像可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new look, PS4 games, and hundreds more Android games.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全新外观、PS4 游戏，以及数百款新增 Android 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new pre-booted snapshot is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新的预启动快照可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pairing file made on a computer lets Husk talk to this %@ the same way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上制作的配对文件可让 Husk 以同样方式与此设备通信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ANDROID": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ANDROID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APK installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 可从游戏库的 + 按钮或“文件”页安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. Split sets — a base APK plus its config pieces — must be picked together; installing the base alone fails on missing native libraries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从资料库的“+”按钮或“文件”页安装 APK。拆分安装包（基础 APK 加配置分包）必须一起选择；只装基础包会因缺少原生库而失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ATTEMPT LOG": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于此应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent Colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Repositories": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用的软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Download": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Geometry Dash First": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先添加 Geometry Dash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Game or App": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加游戏或应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a PS4 game with the + button, as a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder, and play it from your library. Updates install beside their game, shaders are kept between launches, and games that ask for a name bring up the keyboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用“+”按钮添加 PS4 游戏——支持 .pkg 封包、游戏文件夹或解压后的游戏目录，然后从资料库游玩。更新会安装在对应游戏旁边，着色器在多次启动间保留，需要输入名称的游戏会弹出键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a link to an APK or a file, or the address a computer gives you when it shares a folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴一个 APK 或文件的链接，或同一 Wi‑Fi 下电脑共享文件夹时显示的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Husk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到 BetterHusk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first game": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加你的第一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %lld APKs…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %lld 个 APK…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device to the emulator. It can't be saved while this is on, so it boots from cold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为模拟器添加声音设备。开启期间无法保存模拟器状态，因此每次都冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载一个声音设备。挂载期间 Android 无法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加声音设备。连接期间 Android 无法保存（QEMU 拒绝对挂接该设备的机器做快照），因此每次启动都是冷启动。无论开或关，切换都要冷启动一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次下载会多约 2 GB。该快照录制于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次下载增加约 2 GB。该快照在软件渲染器下捕获，启用 GPU 时不使用——GPU 模式会冷启动一次，然后保存自己的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After playing, once per game per update": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游玩后，每个游戏每次更新一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An APK is added to your library when it finishes. Anything else goes into the Shared Storage folder, which games see as their phone storage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 下载完成后会加入游戏库；其他文件会进入共享存储文件夹，游戏会把它当作手机存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Android app. Husk runs its code on its own Java runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 Android 应用。Husk 在自己的 Java 运行时上运行其代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android App Info": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Emulator": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 模拟器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and PS4 games, on your iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的 iPhone 上运行 Android 和 PS4 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 与翻译层游戏都需要 JIT。BetterHusk 内置的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and this app share the memory Husk runs translated code in, and together they do not fit. Close Husk and open it again, then start only the app (or only Android).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 与此应用共用 Husk 用于运行翻译代码的内存，两者同时放不下。请关闭并重新打开 Husk，然后只启动该应用（或只启动 Android）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android can't start without JIT": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有 JIT，Android 无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 直接从文件原位置安装，不会复制任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is booting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is not downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 尚未下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 需要既可写入又可执行的内存，而在 iOS 上只有已附加的调试器才能授予。请选择你的 %@ 获取它的方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android no longer crashes after its download, the full Android emulator moved into Settings with a warning, closing Husk from the app switcher isn't reported as a crash, and much more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 下载后不再崩溃；完整的 Android 模拟器移入“设置”并附带提示；从多任务界面关闭 Husk 不再被记为崩溃；以及更多改进。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 通过一块虚拟网卡访问互联网，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 通过 QEMU 自带网络上的虚拟网卡访问互联网。手机网络中的任何设备都看不到客机，客机也看不到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 为全量模拟运行，比翻译层上的游戏更慢。请用于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps Husk cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 完全以模拟方式运行，比翻译层上的游戏慢。用于 Husk 无法直接运行的应用，如 Termux 或应用商店。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android update ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 更新就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 将冷启动一次，然后保存一个新快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android · Emulator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android · 模拟器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's data partition could not be repaired automatically. Remove Android in Settings and install it again — and if it fails the same way, please send guest-serial.log with the report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 的数据分区无法自动修复。请在“设置”中移除 Android 后重新安装；若仍以同样方式失败，请在报告中附上 guest-serial.log。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's data partition failed to build — restarting Husk will reset it automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 数据分区构建失败——重启 Husk 将自动重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 原生代码对处理器和内存有特定要求，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 原生代码对处理器和内存的要求只有真机才能满足——最重要的是库的代码能否在其数据可写的情况下运行。请先启用 JIT，否则内存检查会被跳过。结果也会写入控制台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's system, its data and the saved machine take %@. Apps and games on the translation layer do not need them. Android downloads again the next time it is started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 的系统、数据和已保存的机器占用 %@。翻译层上的应用和游戏不需要它们。下次启动时会重新下载 Android。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game is already loaded": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有其他游戏在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
