    "Drag a control to move it, or tap one to resize or hide it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动控件可移动位置，点按可调整大小或隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app is played once JIT is on, watched for 15 seconds, and written down; then Husk closes. Open Husk again for the next one. At the end the results file is offered to share.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个应用在 JIT 开启后运行一次，观察 15 秒并记录；随后 BetterHusk 关闭。再次打开 BetterHusk 测试下一个。全部结束后可分享结果文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each time Husk opens without JIT, it asks TrollStore to turn it on. TrollStore's URL Scheme setting must be on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次 BetterHusk 在没有 JIT 的情况下打开时，都会请求 TrollStore 开启它。需要 TrollStore 的 URL Scheme 设置处于开启状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
