    "Hundreds of newly working games on the compatibility list, unofficial ports like Sonic Robo Blast 2, Ring Racers, NetHack and PokeWilds, Flutter games that showed a blank screen draw again, Godot 4 games run, and Python games get online.": {
      "localizations": {
