    "Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 需要可写且可执行的内存，而在 iOS 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 需要既可写入又可执行的内存，在 iOS 上这需要附加一个调试器。有两种途径：响应陷阱请求的调试器，或内核允许任何被调试进程使用的 MAP_JIT 映射。二者满足其一即可——具体哪种可用取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 Husk 会两种都测试而不是想当然。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk now runs on iOS 15.5 and later (PS4 games need iOS 17.4).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 现在支持 iOS 15.5 及更高版本（PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
