          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 在你的 Wi-Fi 中伪装成一台电脑，你的 %@ 会像与 Mac 配对一样与它配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes ": {
