      }
    },
    "Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 直接恢复已保存的机器而非重新启动，只需几秒而非几分钟。写入期间画面会短暂冻结。关闭此项后不会自动保存——包括安装之后。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 在你的 iPhone 上以真实 Android 系统运行未修改的 APK。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 在你的 iPhone 上以真实的 Android 系统运行未经修改的 Android APK。控制台会显示 Husk 的实时日志、客机串口输出和 QEMU 自身输出——排查任何问题都靠这三份日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk turns the screen the way the game asks for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 按游戏要求旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 启动时已被标记为可调试，因此 JIT 已开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use TrollStore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 TrollStore。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's Android runtime is about 760 MB. Android itself follows once it is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 的 Android 运行时约 760 MB。Android 系统会在安装后再下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper (%@) could not be found: %@ Reinstall Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 Husk 的 JIT 助手（%@）：%@ 请重新安装 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper stopped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
