          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was recorded, which usually means iOS ended Husk for using too much memory, or Husk was closed from the app switcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有记录到任何信息，这通常意味着 iOS 因内存占用过高结束了 Husk，或 Husk 被从多任务界面关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noto Sans CJK, the font Android uses for these languages. Games and apps that draw their own text (Unity, Flutter, ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
