    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Husk detaches StikDebug as soon as the ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。一旦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Husk detaches StikDebug as soon as the JIT region is held, because a debugger that iOS has suspended stops the whole app the next time it is needed. Turn this on only to collect StikDebug's own logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。Husk 在取得 JIT 区域后会立即脱离 StikDebug，因为被 iOS 挂起的调试器会在下次需要时阻塞整个应用。仅当需要收集 StikDebug 自身日志时才开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. The full Android emulator is experimental: starting it on launch can cause unwanted bugs, freezes and crashes, and slows every launch. Games and apps don't need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。完整 Android 模拟器为实验性功能：随启动一起运行可能带来意外问题、卡顿和崩溃，并拖慢每次启动。游戏和应用并不需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a computer, make this %@'s pairing file with the [StikDebug pairing-file guide](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上按照 [StikDebug 配对文件指南](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md) 制作此 %@ 的配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Husk needs nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，JIT 是一项设置：越狱会在应用打开时将其标记为“正在被调试”，而被调试的应用可以运行自己写入的代码。Husk 无需其他条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a jailbroken device JIT is a setting. In Dopamine, turn on Allow JIT in Apps, then open Husk again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已越狱的设备上，JIT 是一项设置。在 Dopamine 中打开“允许应用内 JIT”，然后重新打开 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
