    "StikDebug": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Husk. Husk sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Husk inside StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 是一个独立应用，会附加到 Husk。Husk 会自行发送 JIT 脚本，因此无需在 StikDebug 内为 Husk 做任何配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it to turn JIT on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 将打开它来启用 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 将打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug, TrollStore and a jailbreak were not found, so Husk will use its built-in helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未检测到 StikDebug、TrollStore 或越狱，Husk 将使用内置助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT (built in)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT（内置）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built into Husk. You can turn JIT on right here — no computer and no other app. Games and Android both need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT 已内置于 Husk。你可以直接在这里开启 JIT——无需电脑或其他应用。游戏和 Android 都需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
