      }
    },
    "Success: The guest drew frames!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成功：客机已绘制画面！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“跟随系统”与手机一致：白天浅色、夜晚深色。客户系统自己的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own screen stays dark either way — it is a picture of another phone. Holiday decorations appear from December to early January.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“系统”跟随手机：白天浅色，夜晚深色。无论哪种，客机自身的画面保持深色——那是另一台手机的画面。12 月至 1 月初会出现节日装饰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Check setup**. Husk checks LocalDevVPN and prepares the Developer Disk Image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击**检查设置**。Husk 会检查 LocalDevVPN 并准备开发者磁盘镜像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Choose pairing file** and pick it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击**选择配对文件**并选中它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and comes straight back to Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击**连接 LocalDevVPN**。它会开启 VPN 并立即返回 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Enable JIT**. Husk's helper attaches and Android can start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击**启用 JIT**。Husk 的助手附加后 Android 即可启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap with three fingers to show the interface": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三指轻点显示界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical Details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "技术详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 翻译层界面中的技术细节："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: library reports, device checks and run logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 翻译层界面中的技术细节：库报告、设备检查和运行日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested by the Husk team on an iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 Husk 团队在 iPhone 上实测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testing %lld of %lld: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在测试第 %lld/%lld 项：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields in Unity, Java, Flutter, cocos2d-x and SDL games bring up the keyboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unity、Java、Flutter、cocos2d-x 和 SDL 游戏中的文本框现在会唤起键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a bundle Husk can read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件不是 Husk 可识别的安装包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DeveloperTesting folder is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperTesting 文件夹为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The anonymous login service (Aurora's token dispenser) is not working right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匿名登录服务（Aurora 的 token dispenser）目前不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app called %@, a system function Husk does not provide yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用调用了 %@ —— Husk 尚未提供的系统函数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app crashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用已崩溃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app needs a part of Android that Husk's runtime does not provide yet: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用需要 Android 中 Husk 运行时尚未提供的部分：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app refused to run here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用拒绝在此运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's own native code (%@) stopped with %@. It most likely needs something from Android that Husk does not provide yet, or does something iOS does not allow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用自身的原生代码（%@）因 %@ 而停止。它很可能需要 Android 中 Husk 尚未提供的能力，或做了 iOS 不允许的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's video is DRM-protected (Widevine), which only certified Android devices can decrypt. Unprotected video plays; protected video stays black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该应用的视频受 DRM 保护（Widevine），只有经过认证的 Android 设备才能解密。未受保护的视频可正常播放，受保护的视频将保持黑屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded image did not match the release. Tap to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的镜像与发布版本不一致。点击重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end of the log from the last time the game started. Share it when reporting a problem.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏上次启动的日志末尾。反馈问题时请附上它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次检查会下载并挂载 Apple 的开发者磁盘镜像，可能需要一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game and everything it saved here are deleted from Husk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏及其在 BetterHusk 中保存的全部内容都会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not start. Its log is in the game's Technical Details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏无法启动。其日志在该游戏的“技术详情”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game crashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已崩溃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game exited": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game has ended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏启动时界面完全隐藏：没有工具栏、手柄或性能显示。三指同时轻点可唤出，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏以无覆盖层方式启动：没有工具栏、手柄或状态显示。三指同时轻点可唤出工具栏，再次轻点隐藏。游玩时工具栏上的“隐藏”按钮效果相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game stopped": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language apps and games inside Husk see. Husk itself follows your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 内应用和游戏所见到的语言。Husk 自身跟随 iPhone 设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表会写入磁盘，因此在 Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表会写入磁盘，因此在 Android 完成启动前即可显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对文件保存在 BetterHusk 的 Documents 文件夹中，只会发送给 BetterHusk 自带的助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该面板在机器启动时构建，因此修改需要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "面板在机器启动时创建，因此修改需一次冷启动，下次保存会替换旧尺寸下的机器——改回去又要一次。尺寸会取整到 8 的倍数。越大越慢：每个像素都由模拟手机绘制。Android 的密度不随面板变化，所以更大的面板显示更多内容而不是更大字体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整计划见 BetterHusk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告包含那次运行的完整日志、设备与构建信息。除非你主动分享，否则不会发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行时无法启动它。报告会指出缺少的部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime on disk is not a valid image (%@). Tap to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘上的运行时不是有效镜像（%@）。点击重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snapshot did not match the release (sha256 %@, expected %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快照与发布版本不匹配（sha256 %@，应为 %@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to %@. Unmodified APKs install from here too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们会进入 %@。未修改的 APK 也可从这里安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 APK 不含 BetterHusk 可运行的 64 位代码，很可能无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app carries anti-tamper protection (%@). Such protection checks that it runs on a certified Android phone and closes the app otherwise, so it may not start in Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用带有防篡改保护（%@）。此类保护会检查应用是否运行在经过认证的 Android 手机上，否则将关闭应用，因此它可能无法在 Husk 中启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app does its main work in Linux programs it starts as processes of their own (here %@). Its own screens run in Husk, but iOS does not let an app start other processes, so those programs, and the games or tools they run, can not start yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用以独立进程方式启动 Linux 程序来完成主要工作（此处为 %@）。它自身的界面可在 Husk 中运行，但 iOS 不允许应用启动其他进程，因此这些程序及其运行的游戏或工具暂时无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用以多个分包（split APK）发布，但只导入了基础包，导致库或资源缺失。请导入完整安装包（.apks、.xapk 或 .apkm），或从 Husk 商店获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app only works signed in to a Google account. It asked Android to pick one, and Husk has no Google accounts to offer, so the app closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用必须登录 Google 账户才能使用。它请求 Android 选择账户，而 Husk 没有可提供的 Google 账户，因此应用关闭了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than Husk can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用对 Google Play 服务（Google 登录、账户与设备校验）的依赖超出了 Husk 能应答的范围。只用到 Google 库的应用可以运行；这一应用缺少真实服务时就会停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Husk's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备关闭了连接，通常意味着它不再接受 Husk 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is jailbroken, so JIT comes from the jailbreak's Allow JIT in Apps setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备已越狱，JIT 由越狱的“允许应用内 JIT”设置提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not an app Husk can read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件不是 Husk 可识别的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This game keeps most of its data in an expansion file (OBB) that the Play Store downloads separately from the app. Husk installed the app itself but not that file, so the game cannot load.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此游戏的大部分数据放在扩展文件（OBB）中，Play 商店会与应用分开下载它。Husk 只安装了应用本身而未装该文件，因此游戏无法加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone only lets an app run translated code while a debugger enables JIT for it. Open Husk through StikDebug, or tap Turn On JIT in Husk, then start the app again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone 只允许应用在调试器为其启用 JIT 时运行翻译代码。请通过 StikDebug 打开 Husk，或在 Husk 中点击“开启 JIT”，然后重新启动应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装在后台最多只能等待约 30 秒，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装在后台只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往“设置”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 BetterHusk 上，Geode 改为在 Geometry Dash 内运行：在此开启，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 Husk 上，Geode 改为在 Geometry Dash 内运行：在此处（或 Geometry Dash 设置的“Mods”中）开启它，然后启动 Geometry Dash，使用主菜单上的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供 Geode 所需的库，请保留它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This needs %@ more and the device has %@ free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还需要 %@，设备剩余空间为 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This was removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "着色深色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Light": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "着色浅色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tints buttons, switches and selected states throughout the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为全应用的按钮、开关和选中状态着色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To send a whole folder from a computer on the same Wi‑Fi, run this on it and enter the address it shows:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要从同一 Wi‑Fi 下的电脑发送整个文件夹，请在电脑上运行以下命令，并输入它显示的地址："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch always works. A gamepad and a pointer are not wired ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸始终可用。手柄和指针尚未接入，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch always works. A gamepad and a pointer are not wired through to Android yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸始终可用。手柄和指针尚未接入 Android。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch is always on. The keyboard and the rotate control are ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸始终可用。键盘和旋转控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch is always on. The keyboard and the rotate control are in the pill at the bottom of the guest's screen; a gamepad and a pointer are not wired through yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸始终开启。键盘和旋转控制位于客机画面底部的胶囊条中；手柄和指针尚未接入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore can enable JIT for apps it installed, with no pairing file, VPN or computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore 可以为它安装的应用启用 JIT——无需配对文件、VPN 或电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore can turn JIT on for Husk: it opens Husk and enables it, with no computer. In TrollStore's Settings, URL Scheme must be on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore 可以为 Husk 开启 JIT：它打开 Husk 并启用，无需电脑。需在 TrollStore 的“设置”中打开 URL Scheme。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore installs turn JIT on at launch, and Husk says on screen when something can't start without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 TrollStore 安装的 Husk 会在启动时开启 JIT，并且当某功能离开 JIT 无法启动时，Husk 会在屏幕上说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore is installed, so Husk will ask it to enable JIT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 TrollStore，Husk 将请求它启用 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore was not found on this %@. It installs on iOS 14.0 to 17.0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未在此 %@ 上找到 TrollStore。它支持 iOS 14.0 至 17.0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT at Launch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT with StikDebug": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 StikDebug 开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT with TrollStore": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 TrollStore 开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT with TrollStore at Launch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时通过 TrollStore 开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Allow JIT in Apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“允许应用内 JIT”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on JIT": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Wi-Fi, tap **Start pairing** below and allow Local Network access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Wi-Fi，点击下方**开始配对**并允许“本地网络”访问。"
          }
        }
