          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当新的 Android 镜像或快照发布时，BetterHusk 会询问一次是否下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当新的 Android 镜像或快照发布时，Husk 会询问一次是否下载。在 Android 下载前不会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android or a game starts, Husk asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Husk, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每当 Android 或游戏启动，Husk 会请求 TrollStore 启用 JIT。TrollStore 会打开 Husk、短暂附加后放开，使其获准运行自己写入的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android starts, Husk opens StikDebug, which attaches and comes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每当 Android 启动，Husk 会打开 StikDebug，由其附加后返回。"
