      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正常"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "write failed (errno %lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入失败（errno %lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is JIT, and why does Husk need it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是 JIT，为什么 Husk 需要它？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, Husk can show your library but cannot start Android or a game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 应用和游戏在运行时编译，这需要既可写又可执行的内存。iOS 只允许在应用挂了调试器时这样做。开启 JIT 会临时附加一个调试器。没有它，Husk 只能显示你的游戏库，无法启动 Android 或游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which way of turning on JIT should I use?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我该用哪种方式开启 JIT？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• **iOS 27 或更新：** 设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对。无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26：** 内置 StikJIT，配合电脑制作的配对文件和 LocalDevVPN。\n• **更旧的 iOS，或 LiveContainer 内的 Husk：** 使用 StikDebug 应用。\n• **TrollStore 安装：** 使用 TrollStore，并打开其 URL Scheme 设置。\n• **Dopamine 越狱：** 在越狱设置中为应用开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT says it cannot connect, or Enable JIT fails": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT 提示无法连接，或 Enable JIT 失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 确认 **LocalDevVPN** 已安装并连接，状态栏应显示 VPN 图标。\n2. Wi-Fi 必须打开，尽管不会有任何数据离开你的 iPhone。\n3. **开发者模式**必须开启（设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式）。\n4. 首次使用时 Husk 会下载 Apple 的 Developer Disk Image，可能需要一分钟，请耐心等待。\n5. 仍然失败？关闭再打开 LocalDevVPN，然后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Pair with Husk” does not appear in Developer Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者模式中没有出现“与 Husk 配对”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在 Husk 中点击**开始配对**，并在弹出请求时允许**本地网络**访问。如果之前拒绝了，可在 设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › Husk 中打开。Wi-Fi 必须开启。开发者模式需已启用（首次启用会重启 iPhone）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My pairing file stopped working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的配对文件失效了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing files stop working when the iPhone's trust settings are reset, and sometimes after an iOS update. Make a new one, or pair on the iPhone itself if you are on iOS 27, then import it again in Settings › JIT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对文件在 iPhone 信任设置被重置时失效，iOS 更新后有时也会。重新制作一个；如果你用的是 iOS 27，也可以直接在 iPhone 上配对，然后在 设置 › JIT 中重新导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug opens but JIT stays off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 能打开但 JIT 仍是关闭状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open StikDebug on its own and check that it has your pairing file and that LocalDevVPN is connected. Update StikDebug to the latest release. Husk sends StikDebug its script itself, so nothing needs setting up for Husk inside StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单独打开 StikDebug，确认其中有你的配对文件且 LocalDevVPN 已连接，并把 StikDebug 更新到最新版本。Husk 会自己把脚本发给 StikDebug，无需在 StikDebug 内为 Husk 做任何设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why do I have to turn JIT on again?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么每次都要重新开启 JIT？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT lasts as long as Husk is running. When iOS closes Husk in the background, or you swipe it away, the next launch needs JIT again. With Pair on this iPhone or a pairing file it is one tap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JIT 只在 Husk 运行期间有效。当 iOS 在后台关闭 Husk 或你手动划掉它后，下次启动需要重新开启 JIT。使用“在此 iPhone 上配对”或配对文件，只需点一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can I use Husk without JIT?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用 JIT 能用 Husk 吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can browse and import apps, but nothing Android can run. Every game and app needs JIT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以浏览和导入应用，但任何 Android 内容都无法运行。每个游戏和应用都需要 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk Itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 本身"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will not open at all": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 完全打不开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• **秒开秒退：** 签名证书多半已过期。免费 Apple 账号的证书有效期为 7 天。用你的侧载工具重新签名或重装 Husk，应用和存档都会保留。\n• **“不受信任的开发者”：** 前往 设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理 信任你的证书。\n• **要求开发者模式：** 在 设置 › 隐私与安全性 中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk closed while I was playing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "玩游戏时 Husk 突然关闭了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Husk opens again it shows what happened, with a report you can share. Usually the game ran out of memory or hit something Husk does not support yet. Close other apps, and share the report if it keeps happening.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新打开 Husk 时会显示发生了什么，并附带可分享的报告。通常是游戏内存不足或遇到了 Husk 尚不支持的功能。关闭其他应用；如果反复出现，请分享报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do I get logs to report a problem?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何获取日志来反馈问题？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the app's page in your Library and tap **Share Report**. For Husk's own log, go to Settings › About › **Open Console**. Turning on **Developer Info** there adds more detail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在游戏库中打开该应用的页面，点击**分享报告**。Husk 自身的日志在 设置 › 关于 › **打开控制台**。在那里打开**开发者信息**可以看到更多细节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do I update Husk?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何更新 Husk？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk tells you when a new version is out. Install the new IPA over the old one with the same sideloader. Your library, apps and saves are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新版本时 Husk 会提示。用同一个侧载工具把新 IPA 覆盖安装到旧版本上即可，游戏库、应用和存档都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and Games": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用与游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do I add a PS4 game?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何添加 PS4 游戏？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + and pick a fake package (.pkg), a folder of packages, or an extracted game folder (eboot.bin and sce_sys). Husk installs it into PS4 Games in Files, and an update package goes beside the game it updates. Retail packages are locked to a PS4 and do not install. PS4 games need iOS 17.4 or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击 +，选择一个 fake package（.pkg）、一个安装包文件夹，或解压后的游戏文件夹（含 eboot.bin 和 sce_sys）。Husk 会把它装进“文件”里的 PS4 Games，更新包放在对应游戏旁边。零售包绑定在 PS4 上，无法安装。PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4 或更新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An app will not open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个应用打不开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open its page in the Library. Husk says why it stopped:\n• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. Husk does not get around these.\n• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has 32-bit code. Find an arm64 (arm64-v8a) version.\n• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services Husk cannot provide.\n• **Uses something Husk does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在游戏库中打开它的页面，Husk 会说明停止原因：\n• **受保护的应用：** 它会检测是否在真实 Android 手机上运行，或带有反作弊/DRM。Husk 无法绕过这些。\n• **CPU 代码类型不对：** APK 只有 32 位代码，请找 arm64（arm64-v8a）版本。\n• **应用不完整或缺少游戏数据：** APK 需要分包文件或 OBB，请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。\n• **需要 Google：** 应用要求 Google 账号或 Husk 无法提供的 Play 服务。\n• **用到了 Husk 尚不具备的功能：** 分享报告以便后续支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen stays black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕一直黑着"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first launch of a big game prepares its code and data, and can take up to a minute. If it is still black after that, close it, open it once more and share the report if nothing changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大型游戏首次启动要准备代码和数据，可能需要一分钟。如果之后仍黑屏，关闭后重新打开一次；若仍无变化，请分享报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A modded or repacked APK crashes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改版或重新打包的 APK 会崩溃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repacks from sites like APKVISION often turn the app's code into their own library or add tamper checks, and these break more often. Try the original APK from the developer or from APKMirror.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APKVISION 之类网站的重新打包版常把应用代码改成自己的库或加入防篡改检测，更容易崩溃。请改用开发者或 APKMirror 上的原版 APK。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which files can I import?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我可以导入哪些文件？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ".apk, and split bundles as .apks, .xapk or .apkm. Share them to Husk, open them from Files, or tap + in the Library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".apk，以及 .apks、.xapk、.apkm 形式的分包合集。可以分享给 Husk、从“文件”中打开，或在游戏库中点 +。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game runs slowly or the phone gets hot": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏运行缓慢或手机发烫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close other apps and let the phone cool. Games run natively, but some do work on the CPU that a real Android phone does on hardware. Low Power Mode slows Husk down too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭其他应用并让手机降温。游戏是原生运行的，但有些在 CPU 上做的事情在真机上由硬件完成。低电量模式也会让 Husk 变慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can I use a controller?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以用手柄吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes. Connect it to your iPhone in Bluetooth settings, and games that support controllers see it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以。在蓝牙设置中把手柄连接到 iPhone，支持手柄的游戏就能识别它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can I use Husk while a game runs?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏运行时还能用 Husk 吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Open Apps in Windows** in Settings. Apps then open in a window you can move, resize and minimise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在设置中打开**以窗口打开应用**，之后应用会在可移动、可缩放、可最小化的窗口中运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-in with Google does not work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google 登录不了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk has no Google Play services, so “Sign in with Google” buttons can fail. Use email or another sign-in if the app offers one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 没有 Google Play 服务，所以“使用 Google 登录”按钮可能失败。如果应用提供邮箱或其他登录方式，请改用那些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves and Storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存档与存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where are my saves?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的存档在哪里？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app keeps its data inside Husk. On an app's page, **Back Up Saves** exports them and **Restore Saves** brings them back, including onto another iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个应用的数据都保存在 Husk 内。在应用页面中，**备份存档**可导出数据，**恢复存档**可还原——包括还原到另一台 iPhone 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk is using a lot of storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 占用了很多存储空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported apps and their data live in Husk's folder. Remove games you no longer play from their page. The full Android system download is about 2 GB more and is only needed for Android itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入的应用及其数据都在 Husk 的文件夹中。在应用页面中删除不再玩的游戏即可。完整 Android 系统还需约 2 GB，仅 Android 本身需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is the difference between apps and Android?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用和 Android 有什么区别？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most apps and games run directly on your iPhone, the way native apps do. The full Android system is a separate, slower option for anything that only runs inside real Android.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大多数应用和游戏像原生应用一样直接运行在你的 iPhone 上。完整 Android 系统是另一个较慢的选项，用于那些只能在真实 Android 内运行的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android takes a long time to start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 启动很慢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first start downloads the Android image and boots it from cold, which takes a few minutes. After that Husk restores a saved machine, which is much faster.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次启动要下载 Android 镜像并冷启动，需要几分钟。之后 Husk 会直接恢复已保存的机器，快得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't Play Here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法在此游玩"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper is missing from this installation. Reinstall Husk, and keep its app extensions if your sideloader asks, or use StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装缺少 Husk 的 JIT 助手。请重装 Husk，若侧载工具询问请保留其应用扩展，或改用 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request for Husk's JIT helper could not be encoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法编码发给 Husk JIT 助手的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS did not provide the extension API Husk's JIT helper needs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 没有提供 Husk JIT 助手所需的扩展 API。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Husk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全新 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a source to start discovering apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
