    "Search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search games and apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索游戏和应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings & JIT": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置与 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skipped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已跳过"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stuck? Settings › Help answers the common problems, and a game that crashes Husk leaves a report to share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡住了？设置 › 帮助 里有常见问题的答案；让 Husk 崩溃的游戏会留下一份可分享的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + to add an Android APK or bundle (.xapk, .apkm, .apks), or a PS4 game: a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder. You can also share files to Husk from Files or Safari.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击 + 添加 Android APK 或合集（.xapk、.apkm、.apks），或 PS4 游戏：fake package（.pkg）、安装包文件夹或解压后的游戏文件夹。也可以从“文件”或 Safari 分享文件给 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time Zone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trap servicer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trap 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On JIT to Play": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 JIT 后游玩"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Typing everywhere": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随处输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a jailbreak": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用越狱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a pairing file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用配对文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch It Start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看启动过程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With icons": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your games on a shelf, the last one played first. Tap a game to pick it and its artwork fills the screen; tap it again, or press Play, to start it. The ⋯ button has its settings and more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的游戏陈列在架子上，最近玩的排在最前。点一下选中，封面铺满屏幕；再点一下或按“游玩”即可启动。⋯ 按钮里有它的设置和更多选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 15": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 15"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@.%@ is not implemented in Husk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@.%@ 在 Husk 中尚未实现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What apps and games inside Husk speak": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 内运行的应用和游戏使用的语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language apps and games inside Husk see. Husk itself follows your iPhone. Takes effect the next time an app opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 内运行的应用和游戏看到的语言。Husk 本身跟随你的 iPhone 系统语言。下次打开应用时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graphics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vulkan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vulkan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenGL ES": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenGL ES"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BetterHusk detects %@ as %@. Pick another only when detection is wrong — a setup or launcher screen can look like a different engine than the game itself, and a wrong driver usually crashes. Graphics decides whether the game is told Vulkan exists here: OpenGL ES hides it, for games that prefer it but then crash. Applies the next time the game starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 检测到 %@ 是 %@。仅在检测错误时才更改——游戏的设置或启动器界面可能使用与实际游戏不同的引擎，而错误的驱动通常会崩溃。“图形”决定是否告知游戏此设备支持 Vulkan：选择 OpenGL ES 会隐藏 Vulkan，适用于那些优先选择 Vulkan 但随后崩溃的游戏。下次启动游戏时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer — JIT is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer — JIT 已开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer detected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到 LiveContainer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT is on. Games and Android can start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JIT 已开启。游戏和 Android 可以启动了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach with StikDebug": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 StikDebug 附加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Get JIT": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何启用 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BetterHusk is running inside LiveContainer. JIT comes the way LiveContainer gives it to apps — its own launch options or an attached debugger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 正在 LiveContainer 中运行。JIT 由 LiveContainer 提供给应用的方式决定——它自己的启动选项或附加的调试器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BetterHusk is running inside LiveContainer. Both share one process, so JIT for one is JIT for the other -- it just has to be switched on from outside, the way LiveContainer does it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 正在 LiveContainer 中运行。两者共享同一进程，因此为一方开启的 JIT 对另一方同样有效——只是需要按 LiveContainer 的方式从外部开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In **LiveContainer**, open BetterHusk's settings and turn on **JIT** for it (or launch it with JIT).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 **LiveContainer** 中打开 BetterHusk 的设置并为其开启 **JIT**（或以 JIT 方式启动）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or attach **StikDebug** -- it marks the process LiveContainer and BetterHusk share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "或者附加 **StikDebug**——它会标记 LiveContainer 和 BetterHusk 共享的进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back here. This page notices on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回到这里。本页面会自动检测到变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BetterHusk is running inside LiveContainer, so its JIT is LiveContainer's: enable JIT for BetterHusk in LiveContainer's app settings, or attach StikDebug to the process both share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 正在 LiveContainer 中运行，因此它的 JIT 就是 LiveContainer 的 JIT：请在 LiveContainer 的应用设置中为 BetterHusk 开启 JIT，或将 StikDebug 附加到两者共享的进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BetterHusk is running inside LiveContainer: turn JIT on for it in LiveContainer's app settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BetterHusk 正在 LiveContainer 中运行：请在 LiveContainer 的应用设置中为它开启 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ", or attach StikDebug to the process they share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，或将 StikDebug 附加到它们共享的进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built-in JIT cannot start inside LiveContainer. Enable JIT for BetterHusk in LiveContainer's app settings, or attach StikDebug to the shared process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置 JIT 无法在 LiveContainer 内启动。请在 LiveContainer 的应用设置中为 BetterHusk 开启 JIT，或将 StikDebug 附加到共享进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android can't start while a console game is loaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加载主机游戏时无法启动 Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ holds the JIT region. Close and reopen BetterHusk, then start Android first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 占用了 JIT 内存区域。请关闭并重新打开 BetterHusk，然后先启动 Android。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android stopped during startup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 在启动过程中停止了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The emulator ended before the guest finished booting. The log (Settings › Technical details) has the last lines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模拟器在客户系统完成启动前已结束。最后几行信息在日志中（设置 › 技术详情）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up JIT": {
      "localizations": {
